nty years before N-Day would\u2019ve happened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T07:58:08-07:00","id":1462132,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/trinity-continuum-assassins-preview-2-assassins-and-their-code/\" target=\"_blank\">Part 2</a> is on the Code, one of the pillars of the framework that holds the Shadow together","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T11:18:33-07:00","id":1462140,"title":"","content":"Really cool! The code is maybe a bit restrictive for my tastes, but it does fit pretty well thematically. It is a bit unclear to me how any sort of &quot;extra-circulars&quot; are handled. How does a side project that is not a contract work? More of a hypothetical question at this point but really excited for the book!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","name":"econclark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T11:30:18-07:00","id":1462141,"title":"","content":"Restrictive codes are fun to break! And breaking codes creates drama!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T20:59:53-07:00","id":1462215,"title":"","content":"In other time periods I wonder how the shadow interacts with Psi or aberrant powers? Could a powerful Clear 'break through' the shadow?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T05:29:19-07:00","id":1462269,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NewK</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1461026-trinity-continuum-assassins-previews?p=1462215#post1462215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> In other time periods I wonder how the shadow interacts with Psi or aberrant powers? Could a powerful Clear 'break through' the shadow?</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s a very good question.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T06:05:18-07:00","id":1462272,"title":"","content":"To me, it doesn't feels like the shadow is another dimension, but the same reality with a kind of different view. It\u2019s not like you sidestep to shadow like a werewolf sidestep to umbra, and more like wizards entering diagonalley, it\u2019s right there, but people don\u2019t see it because they don\u2019t.<br /> <br /> Ian on Discord talking about normal people and Novas accessing the shadow.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It's less a place and more of a culture, but the weight of this specific culture has a resonance with reality. Novas are already warping reality, so the typical rules don't really apply to them.<br /> Were does the 600-pound gorilla sit? Anywhere he wants. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T09:26:34-07:00","id":1462287,"title":"","content":"Is there a reason there is no <i>Rule the Seventh</i>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T11:38:25-07:00","id":1462301,"title":"","content":"You're not cleared for that yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T15:55:54-07:00","id":1462335,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NullApostle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1461026-trinity-continuum-assassins-previews?p=1462287#post1462287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there a reason there is no <i>Rule the Seventh</i>?</div> </div> </div> </div>It wasn't included in the preview material I was cleared to post.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T18:09:02-07:00","id":1462369,"title":"","content":"Hah! I was actually joking!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-02T00:48:21-07:00","id":1462407,"title":"","content":"My interpretation of the Shadow is that it's a parallel society that exist thanks to the efforts (both conscious and subconscious) of some very powerful talents and a world that does its best to pretend it doesn't exist. <br /> As for the setting, in my head it's, well, the &quot;Shadow&quot; or reverse of the core book. A world of &quot;darkness&quot; if you prefer where the talents instead of fighting to make the world a better place fight to prevent it from getting worse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-03T01:21:23-07:00","id":1462529,"title":"","content":"That is indeed very possible. I can\u2019t wait to see what Assassin Masteries look like!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27083-truemrmultiverse","name":"TrueMrMultiverse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27083_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-07T08:55:20-07:00","id":1463003,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/trinity-continuum-assassins-preview-3-societies/\" target=\"_blank\">Part 3</a> is a look at some of the Societies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-07T20:18:50-07:00","id":1463047,"title":"","content":"My favourite of the Societies is the Signal. A strange broadcast that helps communities solve problems(through murder) is very interesting to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27083-truemrmultiverse","name":"TrueMrMultiverse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27083_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-08T00:32:12-07:00","id":1463066,"title":"","content":"+1 for the Signal <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27023-yuponiha","name":"yuponiha","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-08T00:40:54-07:00","id":1463068,"title":"","content":"I very like concept for <b>Daughters of the Jacobins</b> - continuing bloody work from the French Revolution, where they strove for equality and freedom with the help of assassinations. <br /> <br /> I wonder if <b>Krugu Vorov </b>( rus. Thieves in Law ), also known as Circle, is limited only to Russia and related regions - or that they rule <b>whole</b> organized crime of world? Would Italian Mob also be under Vorovs?<br /> <br /> <b>Signal</b> is very cool, I must admit. 'Anarchist' group of the <b>TC Assassins</b> setting.<br /> <br /> <b>Society of Leonidas </b>is simply 'secret society of assassins with ancient tradition'? Something more would be helpful to imagine them...<br /> <br /> <b>Suzumebachi Group/Swarm </b>seems... exotic. I come from CoD background, I can see something like Cheiron Group - but the Swarm described here is simply... pyramid scheme 'corporation' of assassins? They just take money, no reasons more or purpose...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-08T03:11:36-07:00","id":1463076,"title":"","content":"Hum...I'm not sure which society is meant to be similar to the assassins from assasin's creed...Daughters of the Jacobins? The Signal? Society of Leonidas? Would that make then the Krugu Vorov and Suzumebachi Group/Swarm the sort of Templars?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-08T04:44:26-07:00","id":1463084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1461026-trinity-continuum-assassins-previews?p=1463076#post1463076\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hum...I'm not sure which society is meant to be similar to the assassins from assasin's creed...Daughters of the Jacobins? The Signal? Society of Leonidas? Would that make then the Krugu Vorov and Suzumebachi Group/Swarm the sort of Templars?</div> </div> </div> </div>My guess is this's only a sample of the Societies in the book, and we've not seen all of them (or the full writeups, for that matter). That said, the Society of Leonidas' manipulation of world affairs and desire to bring the world to order seems to echo the Templars...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-08T10:11:27-07:00","id":1463109,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1461026-trinity-continuum-assassins-previews?p=1463076#post1463076\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hum...I'm not sure which society is meant to be similar to the assassins from assasin's creed</div> </div> </div> </div>None of them.<br /> <br /> Not every Society (or Allegiance) is meant to be a 1-to-1 representation of something from popular media. We offer a sampling of different kinds of organizations, and you can mix and match or use them as inspiration to create your own.<br /> <br /> I mean, none of these are the ICA from Hitman either. But given what you see with these Societies, it shouldn't be too hard to build the ICA yourself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-14T07:45:52-07:00","id":1463826,"title":"","content":"And now <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/trinity-continuum-assassins-preview-4-masteries/\" target=\"_blank\">Part 4</a>, the Masteries.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-14T08:04:00-07:00","id":1463827,"title":"","content":"Hmm\u2026 withholding judgment, for now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-14T08:53:54-07:00","id":1463835,"title":"","content":"Still even more excited. I wish it was a full setting!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","name":"econclark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-14T16:38:12-07:00","id":1463906,"title":"","content":"It essentially is. From what I'm seeing, it has about as much in common with the core book's setting as Changeling: the Dreaming has with Hunter: the Reckoning. Poor maybe a better comparison would be to Dragon or Masks of the Mythos. It's technically in the same world at the same time; but it's expressly cordoned off as its own thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-14T23:07:50-07:00","id":1463963,"title":"","content":"I brought this up on the Discord but, here is my take:<br /> So, Masteries seem to be a form of DE. But they also seem to be a result of being a part of a Society. What this is shaping up is that Assassins points to how collective belief can influence the world. That is what is hidden in the subtext of what they have released thus far. Or, at least what I have read from the information released. I think that is what would keep an Assassin from tapping into the Talent based Gifts. See, an Assassin believes in a closed system. &quot;My Society teaches me these Masteries.&quot; And a Talent is more open &quot;Wow, I did not know that I could leap from this tall building and survive. I guess I was just lucky.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-15T03:47:01-07:00","id":1463997,"title":"","content":"My interpretation of masteries is that they are the result of what happens when a Talent finally becomes aware of their power, and I don't mean just from a rational point of view, but also from an emotional and spiritual way. How they understand that power depends on each talent's beliefs, the only thing they have in common is that they are now the &quot;masters&quot; of flux and not just accidental users. It's the kind of evolution I wanted to see in talents and I hope they keep expanding the system for other settings.","signature":"","edited